remote.api on | local | off\n\nON     SD listens on port 4243 and other computers may connect.\nLOCAL  SD listens on port 4243 and only this computer may connect.\nOFF    SD opens no API socket at all.\n\nWith no keyword it reports the current setting and changes nothing.\n\nON and OFF change whether SD opens a socket, which it decides when it starts,\nso they offer to restart SD. LOCAL and ON differ only in the firewall and take\neffect at once.
